# Eaten by Piranhas sets base power and toughness only (layer 7b, ruling): a +1/+1 counter put on Bot1's Ornithopter before the
# Aura still counts (0/2 + 1 = a 2/2 once the base is 1/1), and Battlefield Improvisation's +2/+2 on turn 3 takes it to 4/4
# whenever it began to apply; at the next turn the pump has ended and it is a 2/2 again. Revitalizing Repast also gave it
# indestructible until end of turn, before the Aura: "loses all abilities" is later and takes that away too, as it takes
# the Ornithopter's own flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Revitalizing Repast
Eaten by Piranhas
Battlefield Improvisation
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

